                                        "entry_id": "98101082-1aee-3625-826d-3af673ec7d65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Getting ready; preparing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "informal",
                                            "with-infinitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17c1636f-c2f1-4f32-a598-62c2a00f4a5a",
                                                "sense_id": "bf7ed9f2-78fb-3e44-b5d1-aa0ba25f626b",
                                                "text": "I'm fitting to go home and sleep."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8ed2a5f-54da-4feb-865a-0f97ac03ef29",
                                                "sense_id": "bf7ed9f2-78fb-3e44-b5d1-aa0ba25f626b",
                                                "text": "'I am fitting to go to South Hadley Seminary [as Mount Holyoke was known], and expect if my health is good to enter that institution a year from next fall', she confided to Abiah."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fitting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                        "entry_id": "ad6770da-e14d-34f7-b858-e909ff895c1a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Appropriate; suitable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe0d861b-e50d-4088-aa41-6038309cb13a",
                                                "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                                "text": "Though all your actions are noble, […] is it fitting that I should accompany you alone into these perplexed retreats? Should we be found together, what would a censorious world think of my conduct?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f7b8e52-c9d1-4cdb-9721-1a82f01091da",
                                                "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                                "text": "The last regular steam-hauled passenger train between Glasgow and Helensburgh Central was given a fitting send-off from Queen Street Low Level at 11.2 p.m. on Friday, November 4."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9988ae09-8670-4092-865f-828ecbfdce83",
                                                "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                                "text": "It was a fitting scoreline on the club's landmark anniversary, and appropriate that Van Persie should get the winner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "501a11fc-0703-428f-8789-802e0c461389",
                                                "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                                "text": "And really, Michael Jackson is a more fitting aspiration for the similarly sexless would-be-former teen heartthrob, who’s compared himself to the late King Of Pop (perhaps a bit prematurely) on several occasions and sings in a Jackson-like croon over a sample of “We’ve Got A Good Thing Going” on Believe’s “Die In Your Arms.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5cade184-d980-4290-b219-da81aacaa67a",
                                                "sense_id": "aa12be78-be02-3b6d-b4d7-292b298b2592",
                                                "text": "The L&YR built a small number of these trains, known as 'Rail Motors', for rural branch lines. It was only fitting that the Horwich branch should have its own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fitting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
